### ================================================================
### All endpoints now need login. REST requests use HTTP Basic auth:
###   Authorization: Basic <username> <password>
### Default admin (from application.properties): admin / admin123
### Run the requests top to bottom: the admin first creates a
### teacher and a student, then each of them tests their own access.
### Browser login: http://localhost:8081/login   logout: /logout
### ================================================================


### ---------- ADMIN: can manage everything ----------

### Admin creates a teacher (with login credentials)
POST http://localhost:8081/teachers
Authorization: Basic admin admin123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sadi Sir",
  "email": "sadi@kuet.ac.bd",
  "username": "sadi",
  "password": "teacher123"
}

### Admin creates a student (with login credentials)
POST http://localhost:8081/students
Authorization: Basic admin admin123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Suhita Islam Aurthi",
  "roll": "2207052",
  "username": "suhita",
  "password": "student123"
}

### Admin creates another admin
POST http://localhost:8081/admins
Authorization: Basic admin admin123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin2",
  "password": "SadiAdmin123",
  "email": "admin123@gmail.com"
}

### Admin lists everything (passwords are NOT returned)
GET http://localhost:8081/admins
Authorization: Basic admin admin123

###
GET http://localhost:8081/teachers
Authorization: Basic admin admin123

###
GET http://localhost:8081/students
Authorization: Basic admin admin123

###
GET http://localhost:8081/admins/1
Authorization: Basic admin admin123

###
PUT http://localhost:8081/admins/2
Authorization: Basic admin admin123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin2",
  "email": "Admin@gmail.com"
}

###
DELETE http://localhost:8081/admins/2
Authorization: Basic admin admin123


### ---------- TEACHER: can manage teachers only ----------

### Teacher -> teachers : 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8081/teachers
Authorization: Basic sadi teacher123

### Teacher -> teachers by id : 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8081/teachers/1
Authorization: Basic sadi teacher123

### Teacher creates a teacher : 200 OK
POST http://localhost:8081/teachers
Authorization: Basic sadi teacher123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Another Teacher",
  "email": "another@cse.kuet.ac.bd",
  "username": "teacher2",
  "password": "teacher456"
}

### Teacher updates a teacher (password optional on update) : 200 OK
PUT http://localhost:8081/teachers/1
Authorization: Basic sadi teacher123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sadi Sir",
  "email": "Sadi@cse.kuet"
}

### Teacher -> students : 403 Forbidden
GET http://localhost:8081/students
Authorization: Basic sadi teacher123

### Teacher -> admins : 403 Forbidden
GET http://localhost:8081/admins
Authorization: Basic sadi teacher123


### ---------- STUDENT: can manage students only ----------

### Student -> students : 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8081/students
Authorization: Basic suhita student123

### Student -> student by id : 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8081/students/1
Authorization: Basic suhita student123

### Student updates a student : 200 OK
PUT http://localhost:8081/students/1
Authorization: Basic suhita student123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Suhita Islam Aurthi",
  "roll": "2207052"
}

### Student -> teachers : 403 Forbidden
GET http://localhost:8081/teachers
Authorization: Basic suhita student123

### Student -> admins : 403 Forbidden
GET http://localhost:8081/admins
Authorization: Basic suhita student123


### ---------- No login / wrong password ----------

### No credentials : 401 Unauthorized
GET http://localhost:8081/students
Accept: application/json

### Wrong password : 401 Unauthorized
GET http://localhost:8081/students
Authorization: Basic suhita wrongpass

### Duplicate username : 409 Conflict
POST http://localhost:8081/students
Authorization: Basic admin admin123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Someone",
  "roll": "2207099",
  "username": "sadi",
  "password": "x12345"
}


### ---------- Clean-up (admin) ----------
DELETE http://localhost:8081/teachers/2
Authorization: Basic admin admin123
